---
import MainLayout from '../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../../components/ContactCTA.astro';

const title = 'Kitchen Drain Cleaning in Mason City, IA | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'Kitchen drain cleaning for slow sinks, blocked kitchen drain lines, garbage disposal problems, and dishwasher backups. A-1 Drain Cleaning serves Mason City and surrounding communities.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/services/kitchen-drains/" breadcrumbLabel="Kitchen Drains" service={{ title: 'Kitchen Drain Cleaning & Garbage Disposal Service', description }}>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container py-14 sm:py-18 lg:py-24">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-300">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-white">Services</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="text-white">Kitchen Drains</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">Kitchen drains • Mason City • Nearby Communities</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Kitchen Drain Cleaning</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A slow kitchen sink can start with grease, food residue, or other material narrowing the drain. A-1 Drain Cleaning cleans and unclogs kitchen sink drains in Mason City and nearby communities.</p>
        <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-start">
        <article>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Kitchen drains</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Slow kitchen sink? The blockage may be close to the fixture.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Kitchen drains commonly collect grease, food residue, and other material. A drain may get slower over time before it stops completely.</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Kitchen sink drains slowly</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Kitchen sink will not drain</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Water stands in the sink</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Sink backs up when another fixture is used</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Other services are listed separately</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">Garbage disposal repair and installation is a separate service from kitchen drain cleaning. Dishwasher drain service is also handled on its own page.</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4"><a href="/services/garbage-disposal/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Garbage Disposal Repair and Installation</a></li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4"><a href="/services/dishwasher-drain/" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-4">Dishwasher Drain Service</a></li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">One kitchen sink or several drains?</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">If only the kitchen sink is affected while the rest of the house drains normally, the restriction may be close to the kitchen fixture or its branch drain. If several fixtures back up together, the problem may be farther down a shared drain or main line.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Do not pour grease down the sink. Let it cool and put it in the trash instead. When a kitchen drain is already backing up, avoid adding more water until the blockage is removed.</p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Kitchen drain service in Mason City and nearby communities</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning serves Mason City and nearby communities. When you call, tell us whether the kitchen sink is slow or completely stopped and whether the problem changes when another fixture is used.</p>
        </article>

        <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 shadow-sm">
            <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Kitchen drain problem?</p>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Call A-1 Drain Cleaning</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Slow or stopped kitchen sink? Call 641-530-2728.</p>
            <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-5 block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-6 py-4 text-center font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">Call 641-530-2728</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
    <ContactCTA />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
